# era-bank-core — module map (ops API)

Kernel routes consumed by `era-bank` BFF (prefix `/api/v1/`).

## GL (ledger)

| Method | Path | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| GET | `/gl/accounts` | Chart of accounts |
| GET | `/gl/trial-balance` | Trial balance snapshot |
| POST | `/accounts` | Open customer account |
| GET | `/accounts` | List — filters `customerId`, `branchId`, `iban`, `status` |
| GET | `/accounts/:id` | Detail + holds |
| GET | `/accounts/:id/statement` | Movements `from` / `to` |
| POST | `/accounts/:id/close` | Close — zero available balance, no ACTIVE holds |
| POST | `/accounts/:id/holds` | Place hold |
| DELETE | `/accounts/:id/holds/:holdId` | Release hold |

## Postings

| Method | Path | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| GET | `/postings` | Queue — `status`, `branchId`, `type`, dates |
| GET | `/postings/:id` | Detail + legs |
| POST | `/postings/cash-deposit` | Teller template |
| POST | `/postings/cash-withdrawal` | Teller template |
| POST | `/postings/internal-transfer` | Teller template |
| POST | `/postings/:id/approve` | Checker from JWT |
| POST | `/postings/:id/reject` | PENDING → REJECTED |
| POST | `/postings/:id/reverse` | Reversal |

## Branches

| Method | Path | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| POST | `/branches/cross-branch-withdrawal` | MFR wrapper |

## CIF

| Method | Path | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| GET | `/cif/customers?q=` | Search FIN/VÖEN/ID |
| POST | `/cif/customers` | Onboard NATURAL/LEGAL |

## Payments / deposits / loans

| Module | Routes |
|--------|--------|
| Payments | `GET/POST /payments/orders`, `GET /payments/orders/:id`, `POST .../submit`, `POST /payments/inbound` |
| Payments cash | `/payments/standing-orders`, `/payments/virtual-accounts`, `/payments/cheques`, `/payments/sweep-rules`, `/payments/nostro-statement-import` |
| Deposits | `GET/POST /deposits`, `GET /deposits/wht-registry` (lab WHT export), `GET /deposits/:id`, `POST .../close`, `POST .../rollover` (maturity extend only) |
| Loan collateral items | `GET/POST /loans/collateral-items`, `POST /loans/collateral-items/:itemId/revalue`, `GET/POST /loans/:id/collateral-links` |
| Loans | `GET/POST /loans`, `GET /loans/:id`, `GET .../schedule`, `POST .../disburse`, `.../repay`, `.../prepay`, `.../restructure`, `PATCH .../quality-flags` |
| Loans deep | applications, credit-lines, drawdowns, score, collateral valuations, liens |
| Leasing | `GET/POST /leasing/assets`, `GET/POST /leasing/contracts`, `GET .../schedule`, `GET .../buyout-quote`, `POST .../accrue-finance-income` (IFRS 16 lab) |
| MFI | `GET/POST /mfi/groups`, `POST .../members`, `.../activate`, `.../originate-jlg`, `GET /mfi/par30-by-officer`, `GET/POST .../collection-sheets`, `POST /mfi/collection-sheets/:id/collect` (lab) |
| Loans CKR lab | `GET /loans/ckr/queue`, `GET /loans/ckr/journal`, `POST /loans/ckr/validate-pack`, `POST /loans/ckr/submit-stub` (live fail-closed) |

## BE Lite→Deep L2

| Module | Routes |
|--------|--------|
| Fees / SDB / packages | `/fees/tariffs`, `/fees/assess`, `/fees/packages`, `/fees/safe-deposit-boxes` |
| Cash | `/cash/movements`, `/cash/inventory`, `/cash/queue` |
| Collections | `/collections/cases` (+ assign/ptp/recover/write-off) |
| Trade | `/trade/lc`, `/trade/guarantees`, `/trade/dc`, `/trade/scf`, `/trade/swift` |
| Islamic | `/islamic/contracts` |
| Wealth | `/wealth/safekeeping`, `/wealth/positions/receive`, `/wealth/insurance-commissions` |
| AML extras | `/aml/cases`, `/aml/fraud/score` |
| Risk extras | `/risk/collateral`, `/risk/collateral-items` (stale flags, RISK_READ), `/risk/irrbb/inputs`, `/risk/oprisk/...`, `/risk/prudential/last`, `/risk/prudential/run`, `/risk/prudential/loans/:loanId/write-off` (ümidsiz), `/risk/prudential/:id/provision-approve` |
| Reg CBAR templates | `GET /reports/cbar/templates` (filtered by InstitutionType pack) |
| Webhooks | `GET/POST /webhooks/subscriptions`, `POST .../deliver`, `POST .../enqueue`, `GET /webhooks/outbox`, `POST /webhooks/outbox/drain` (durable outbox + HMAC) |
| MIS | `GET /mis/report-keys`, `POST /mis/assemble` (thin JSON/CSV — not full BI) |
| Deposits ADIF | `GET /deposits/adif-registry-snapshot` (lab-2; official file [U]) |
| DBO customer | `GET /dbo/loans`, `GET /dbo/loans/:id`, `POST /dbo/loans/:id/prepay`, `GET /dbo/leasing/contracts`, `GET /dbo/leasing/contracts/:id/schedule` |
| DBO ops | H2H jobs + OB consents (`scaChallengeId` required; no CBAR gateway) |

