## Internal (orchestrator Sync — no `/api/v1` prefix)

| Method | Path | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| GET/POST | `/api/internal/v1/organization/bind` | Org UUID bind; Bearer `SATELLITE_EVENT_SERVICE_TOKEN` (or bank service tokens); excluded from global `api/v1` prefix |
| GET/POST | `/api/internal/v1/runtime-config` | Desired-state runtime config (SSO, event token, activeModules); same auth + prefix exclusion as bind |

